{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35211","headline":"住京寄同志 · 聂夷中","name":"住京寄同志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"在京如在道，日日先鸡起。\n不离十二街，日行一百里。\n役役大块上，周朝复秦市。\n贵贱与贤愚，古今同一轨。\n白兔落天西，赤鵶飞海底。\n一日复一日，日日无终始。\n自嫌性如石，不达荣辱理。\n试问九十翁，吾今尚如此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"聂夷中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}